{"unit_id":"GRmaid__dsh-LimBusCompany-dancinglyrics-toast#card-zh","repo":"GRmaid/dsh-LimBusCompany-dancinglyrics-toast","commit":"33b39a04714abf65bc5dbdcfd940149ff9b69fb9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-LimBusCompany-dancinglyrics-toast 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Windows 桌面提示插件。它监听会话授权与回合开始、结束事件，将可编辑的提示文案通过本机 SSE 交给 Electron 伴侣窗口，以逐字动画显示在桌面上。用户可在设置页调整事件开关、模板、字体、颜色、动画和提示位置，也可推送测试动画。适合想在工作时从桌面快速看到 DSH 会话进度的用户。运行伴侣需要 Windows 和 Electron；插件不要求 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/entry.js:39-65","lib/entry.js:188-199","lib/entry.js:275-290","lib/entry.js:377-419","companion/main.js:27-52","lib/client.js:461-470"]}
